    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Login",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Login API",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://apis.rmlconnect.net/auth/v1/login/",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Login APIs provide a secure and standardized way for end users to add user authentication to their applications. Only authorized users can access sensitive resources or perform specific actions within the application after entering the user authentication details.\n\n**By default, the JSON Web Token (JWT) validity periods are set to one hour.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "RCS Messages API",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "RCS Messages API",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://apis.rmlconnect.net/rcs/v1/message",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "The Rich Communication Services (RCS) Business Messaging API is a communication protocol that allows businesses to send different types of messages beyond traditional text messages. \n\nThe RCS Business Messaging API allows businesses to send different types of messages that include:\n\n- **Notification API:** Standard messages that send plain text or media content. \n- **Session API:** Standard text messages that send plain text content as part of a campaign. \n- **India Template API:** Create intera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Bulk Upload Campaign API",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Bulk Upload Campaign",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://apis.rmlconnect.net/rcs/v1/bulk_message",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Bulk Upload Campaign APIs send messages to many recipients simultaneously using a batch upload process. It allows businesses to efficiently send personalized and interactive messages to their customers at scale. "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Payment API",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Payment API",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://apis.rmlconnect.net/payments/v1/send_bill",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "The Payment Template API allows businesses to integrate payment functionality into their RCS messages. With this API, businesses can create payment templates that enable users to make secure payments directly within the RCS messaging experience.\n\nThe API will use the provided phone number to send the payment template message to the recipient via RCS. The template will include the specified variables and their corresponding values, allowing you to customize the payment details for each recipient."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
