            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "The Bulk DND Set API allows you to whitelist or blacklist a batch of phone numbers for a specific RCS bot. Provide the URL of a previously uploaded CSV file (from the File Upload API) containing the phone numbers, and set `dnd_mode` to control whether those numbers are blacklisted (`true`) or whitelisted (`false`)."
        }
